    "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Your ICAHCR 2026 presentation slot</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }\n  .email { max-width: 550px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 28px; }\n  p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  a { color: #1a1a1a; }\n  .small { font-size: 13px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; }\n  hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 24px 0; }\n  @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {\n    .email { padding: 24px 18px; }\n    p { font-size: 14px; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"email\">\n\n<p>Hi {{name}},</p>\n\n<p>I'm reaching out because you submitted a paper to ICAHCR 2026 — thank you for that. Your paper is currently under review by our committee.</p>\n\n<p>I wanted to let you know that the conference is on <strong>August 22–23, 2026</strong>, and we have about 9 days left before it begins. Right now we still have presentation slots open for registered presenters, but they're filling quickly.</p>\n\n<p>Registration for students and scholars is <strong>₹2,500</strong>. You can complete it here:<br>\n<a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/register\">https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/register</a></p>\n\n<p>If you'd like to see the full conference agenda before registering, it's available here:<br>\n<a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/agenda\">https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/agenda</a></p>\n\n<p>A few things worth knowing:</p>\n\n<p>— All accepted papers are published in ISBN proceedings with a DOI for each paper.<br>\n— The conference is fully virtual, so you can present from anywhere.<br>\n— ICAHCR 2026 is ScholarVault Verified (Platinum, 92/100), so there are no hidden charges or predatory practices.</p>\n\n<p>If you have any questions about your paper status or registration, just reply to this email and I'll help you directly.</p>\n\n<p>Best regards,<br>\nThe ICAHCR 2026 Organising Team<br>\n<a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/\">aihealth.scholarvault.in</a></p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p class=\"small\">ICAHCR 2026 · AI in Healthcare & Clinical Research<br>\nAugust 22–23, 2026 · Virtual / Online<br>\nOrganised by ScholarVault · conferences@scholarvault.in<br>\n<a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/refund\">Refund Policy</a> · <a href=\"https://aihealth.scholarvault.in/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n\n<p class=\"small\">You're receiving this email because you submitted a paper to ICAHCR 2026.</p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
